note contract 5 fresh, line 122: the then arm writes element 0, the else arm element 1; the
note intersection at the join is empty, so get s 0 is error 27. Union-join mutant: {0,1} accepts;
note main passes c = 2 and a filled with 99, so the mutant prints 99 (exp/f5-join-diff.mutant).
om2
fn f s edit uchar 8 fresh c ulong to ulong
if eq c 1
put s 0 11
else
put s 1 22
end
ret ulong get s 0
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 8 99
putd f a 2
ret 0
end
